            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hitchens'Pupil"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used freshly squeezed oranges for the juice, half a lemon to augment the orange. I used soy sauce but also added brown sugar, crystallized ginger, a little onion powder, and lemon pepper. I have pork chops in a 24 hr. soy sauce/hemp oil marinade just waiting for this reduction. P.S. Hemp oil has a natural nuttiness that adds to the dishes complexity."
          },
